      <div class="story-section__img">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/5890/1079/files/BOSCHI0919.jpg"
             alt="Artisan TIRABOSCHI — couture sellier"
             loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="story-section__body">
        <p class="story-num">01 / 05</p>
        <p class="story-label">Savoir-Faire</p>
        <h2 class="story-title" id="story-1-title">Un seul artisan,<br>de A à Z</h2>
        <p class="story-text">
          {%- if fabrication != blank -%}
            {{ fabrication }}
          {%- else -%}
            Chaque pièce TIRABOSCHI est fabriquée par un seul artisan, du traçage de la première pièce à la pose de la dernière ferrure. Aucune chaîne, aucune division du travail. Cette règle, inchangée depuis 1904.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <div class="story-stats">
          <div class="story-stat"><span class="story-stat__num">1</span><span class="story-stat__label">Artisan</span></div>
          <div class="story-stat"><span class="story-stat__num">3 400</span><span class="story-stat__label">Points de couture</span></div>
          <div class="story-stat"><span class="story-stat__num">48–72h</span><span class="story-stat__label">De fabrication</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section story-section--flip" aria-labelledby="story-2-title" data-tira-reveal>
    <div class="story-section__inner">
      <div class="story-section__img">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/5890/1079/files/BOSCHI0154.jpg"
             alt="Détail matière cuir — TIRABOSCHI Paris"
             loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="story-section__body">
        <p class="story-num">02 / 05</p>
        <p class="story-label">La Matière</p>
